    "scope": "US and major developed-market inflation and wholesale price data; central-bank policy expectations and guidance (Fed, BOJ, ECB, RBA, RBI); sovereign bond markets and yields (US Treasuries, JGBs); investor portfolio flows into gold and safe havens; FX moves and interventions (yen, dollar); fiscal supply signals (US budget/deficit).",
